sect1.para:
We have noticed invalid memory access when using dynamically allocated SAMG_Solver objects and their calls to SAMG. To avoid that, use static(stack) instantiation. Right now we have no idea why, but we're working on that... //i.e.:
SAMG_Settingssettings;
settings.Set_napproach(2);
SAMG_SolversamgSolver(&settings);
PDE_Integrator<DIM,Region>pressure_diffusion(&samgSolver);
